Before implementing, reviewing or refactoring, read @AGENTS.md at the repository
root, including its Karpathy-inspired coding discipline and applicable standards.
That file is canonical; this rule adds no separate policy or permission requirement.

State material assumptions, keep the solution simple and changes scoped, preserve
unrelated work, and verify observable success criteria. Continue authorized work;
ask only about material unresolved decisions. Read the active release plan and
spec/plan/tasks/verification, retaining the distinction between code, tests and
native/device acceptance. Graphify is a navigation aid, not proof of completion.
